<p>Your face melts, exploding in a targeted gush of blood and gore dealing <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>spellpower 100">63, 84, 101, 116, 128</acronym> darkness damage (<acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>spellpower 100">314, 422, 507, 578, 641</acronym> total) in a cone over 5 turns.</p><p>Each turn the target will be dealt an additional <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>spellpower 100">44, 59, 71, 81, 90</acronym> blight damage per disease.</p><p>Damage will increase with your Spellpower.</p>